{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42292","headline":"和陈洗马山庄新泉 · 徐铉","name":"和陈洗马山庄新泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已开山馆待抽簪，更要岩泉欲洗心。\n常被松声迷细韵，忽流花片落高岑。\n便疏浅濑穿莎径，始有清光映竹林。\n何日煎茶酝香酒，沙边同听暝猨吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}